# 2026-11-04, arm A of one by-hand Pixel 8a A/B (not page rows: the campaign names hold no `dashboard`, so the
# dashboard page never reads them as a weekly sitting): litert-community/Qwen3-0.6B (Qwen3-0.6B_dynamic_wi4b32_afp32.litertlm,
# Hub main LFS sha256 bf1aba9ce8d9..., 343,490,560 B, the file of Hub commit 2670e142, 2026-10-31) on the
# protocol row, native-benchmark-1024x256 = litert_lm_advanced_main --benchmark, prefill forced to exactly 1024 tokens,
# decode 256, context 2048 (methodology/agreed-protocol-gemma4.md "The spec"), LiteRT-LM CPU on the side build v0.18.0
# (android/engine-pins.json litert-lm.v0.18.0 = android/bin/v0.18.0, the Android pin from 2026-10-15 to 2026-10-31),
# pushed for the sitting into /data/local/tmp/llmbench/engines/v0.18.0 (run_cell.py reads the model through a link in
# that dir, so this build keeps its own XNNPACK cache) and removed after it.
# Arm B is matrices/d549-qwen306b-pixel8a-cpu-0190-android.cells (the flat pinned v0.19.0): the same file bytes and the
# same forced token counts, so the build is the one variable. The engine A/B (results/raw/2026-11-04-d546eng-
# qwen306b-engine-pixel8a-android) ran free generation, where the two builds produced different token sequences.
# One launch per runner start (runs=1), started by d549_work/slot.sh in the order A B B A A B, each arm into its own
# campaign dir (this one: 2026-11-04-d549ab-qwen306b-cpu-0180-pixel8a-android); the runner's 120 s cooldown and thermal
# wait before each launch, taskset f0 (the dashboard job's Pixel 8a mask), BENCH_SITTING=1 (each launch checked against
# its pins entry). engine-build= is not part of a cell's key (run_campaign.cell_id, the record names), hence one file
# and one campaign dir per arm. The anchors (matrices/anchors.cells, its two Android rows) run first as their
# own campaign. This row = the CPU row of matrices/d541-qwen35-s26-android.cells with the model and the file changed,
# engine-build=v0.18.0 and runs=1 added.
android litert-lm litert-community/Qwen3-0.6B native-benchmark-1024x256 backend=cpu engine-build=v0.18.0 file=Qwen3-0.6B_dynamic_wi4b32_afp32.litertlm context-tokens=2048 runs=1
